---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import EnquiryForm from '../components/EnquiryForm.astro';

const partnersSchema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@graph': [
    {
      '@type': 'WebPage',
      '@id': 'https://adulttoysglobal.com/partners/#webpage',
      url: 'https://adulttoysglobal.com/partners/',
      name: 'BOHOL | Business Enquiries, Retail Distribution & OEM Partners',
      description: 'Explore the BOHOL product range and prepare a model-specific enquiry for retail, distribution or private-label discussions.',
      inLanguage: 'en-US',
      author: {
        '@type': 'Person',
        name: 'Alex Chen',
        jobTitle: 'Chief Engineering Director & Hardware Architect',
        worksFor: { '@type': 'Organization', name: 'BOHOL' },
        url: 'https://adulttoysglobal.com/about/'
      },
      publisher: {
        '@type': 'Organization',
        name: 'BOHOL',
        url: 'https://adulttoysglobal.com',
        logo: {
          '@type': 'ImageObject',
          url: 'https://adulttoysglobal.com/images/bohol-logo-horiz-dark.webp'
        }
      },
      datePublished: '2024-01-01T08:00:00+08:00',
      dateModified: new Date().toISOString()
    },
    {
      '@type': 'FAQPage',
      mainEntity: [
        {
          '@type': 'Question',
          name: 'How do I ask about minimum quantities and pricing?',
          acceptedAnswer: {
            '@type': 'Answer',
            text: 'Include the exact model, destination market and quantities you are considering in the brief. Standard wholesale MOQ starts at 50 to 100 units with volume tiered discounts available.'
          }
        },
        {
          '@type': 'Question',
          name: 'Can I discuss private-label or OEM requirements?',
          acceptedAnswer: {
            '@type': 'Answer',
            text: 'Yes, BOHOL provides custom laser logo engraving, custom Pantone silicone colorways, custom luxury gift packaging, and proprietary tooling support.'
          }
        },
        {
          '@type': 'Question',
          name: 'Which quality and compliance reports can I request?',
          acceptedAnswer: {
            '@type': 'Answer',
            text: 'BOHOL provides certified test reports for ISO 9001, ISO 13485:2016, CE-EMC, RoHS 2.0, FCC Part 15, and UN38.3 lithium battery transport manifests.'
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
};
---
<Layout
  title="BOHOL | Business Enquiries, Retail Distribution & OEM Partners"
  description="Explore the BOHOL product range and prepare a model-specific enquiry for retail, distribution or private-label discussions."
  schema={partnersSchema}
>
  <section class="section partner-intro">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">FOR BUSINESS PARTNERS · OEM / ODM / WHOLESALE</p>
      <h1>Start with the right conversation.</h1>
      <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 12px; font-size: 12px; color: #475569; margin: 12px 0 16px; padding: 6px 12px; background: #f8fafc; border-radius: 6px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;">
        <span>Manufacturer: <strong>BOHOL</strong></span>
        <span>•</span>
        <span>Director: <strong>Alex Chen</strong></span>
        <span>•</span>
        <span>Updated: <time datetime={new Date().toISOString().split('T')[0]}>{new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-US', { month: 'short', day: 'numeric', year: 'numeric' })}</time></span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p>Exploring a retail collection or a brand project? Begin with the products, the market and the details you need to confirm.</p>
      <p>Our catalogue gives you a shared starting point. Use the brief below to collect your shortlist and requirements.</p>
      <a href="/catalogue/" class="text-link">Explore the business catalogue <Icon name="arrow-up-right"/></a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section company-facts">
    <p class="eyebrow">A CLEARER START</p>
    <div class="principle-list">
      <div>
        <span>01</span>
        <h3>Choose your models.</h3>
        <p>Review the product photography and specifications. Note the preferred designs, variants and quantities.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <span>02</span>
        <h3>Outline the project.</h3>
        <p>Include your destination market, retail channel and any logo, packaging or other requirements you want to discuss.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <span>03</span>
        <h3>Confirm the details.</h3>
        <p>Model availability, customization feasibility, documentation, pricing and timing require project-specific confirmation.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section partner-capability">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">SUPPLIER CAPABILITY</p>
        <h2>How Do We Integrate Factory Questions into Your Project Brief?</h2>
      </div>
      <a class="text-link" href="/manufacturing/">View manufacturing page <Icon name="arrow-up-right"/></a>
    </div>
    <div class="capability-cards">
      <div>
        <img src="/images/factory-workshop.webp" width="1024" height="768" loading="lazy" alt="BOHOL Assembly Workshop and Lean Production Lines"/>
        <h3>Production & Assembly</h3>
        <p>Confirm tooling construction, colorways, PCB configuration, and sample turnaround before proceeding to volume production.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <img src="/images/factory-quality.webp" width="1024" height="768" loading="lazy" alt="BOHOL Quality Control and Testing Laboratory"/>
        <h3>Quality & Lab Testing</h3>
        <p>Request certified test reports, IPX7 waterproof validations, acoustic decibel readings, and market-specific compliance documents.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <img src="/images/factory-packing.webp" width="1024" height="768" loading="lazy" alt="BOHOL Packaging Workshop and Retail Box Assembly"/>
        <h3>Packaging & Fulfillment</h3>
        <p>Review bespoke luxury gift box design, barcode serialization, pallet consolidation, and worldwide DDP container shipping.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" style="padding-top:0;">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">CLIENT ENGAGEMENT & PRIVATE-LABEL SUITES</p>
        <h2>How Can You Experience Our 500 m² Showroom & Strategy Suites?</h2>
      </div>
      <a class="text-link" href="#enquiry">Book an in-person or virtual walkthrough <Icon name="arrow-up-right"/></a>
    </div>
    <div class="hq-campus-grid">
      <article class="hq-card">
        <img src="/images/hq-showroom.webp" width="1024" height="768" loading="lazy" alt="BOHOL 500 m² Flagship Product Experience Showroom"/>
        <div class="hq-card-body">
          <span class="hq-card-tag">500 m² SHOWROOM</span>
          <h3>Comprehensive Product Exhibition</h3>
          <p>Hands-on examination of all 14 hardware series, retail packaging variants, merchandising displays, and consumable collections.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="hq-card">
        <img src="/images/hq-boardroom.webp" width="1024" height="768" loading="lazy" alt="BOHOL Executive OEM Strategy Boardroom"/>
        <div class="hq-card-body">
          <span class="hq-card-tag">PROJECT STRATEGY</span>
          <h3>Private-Label Joint Strategy</h3>
          <p>Work directly with lead engineers on custom mold feasibility, proprietary PCB firmware, and bilateral NDA compliance.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="hq-card">
        <img src="/images/hq-vip-lounge.webp" width="1024" height="768" loading="lazy" alt="BOHOL VIP Distributor Sample Negotiation Lounge"/>
        <div class="hq-card-body">
          <span class="hq-card-tag">VIP EVALUATION</span>
          <h3>Hands-On Tactile Sampling</h3>
          <p>Inspect platinum silicone finishes, test noise levels, review Pantone swatches, and finalize bespoke packaging unboxing experiences.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section enquiry-layout" id="enquiry">
    <div class="enquiry-sidebar">
      <p class="eyebrow">YOUR PRODUCT BRIEF</p>
      <h2>How Do You Structure Your Custom Product Brief for Fast Turnaround?</h2>
      <p>A short, specific brief helps keep the product discussion focused. Prepare a copy for your own records and correspondence.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Exact product names and preferred colors</li>
        <li>Destination market and expected quantities</li>
        <li>Packaging or branding requirements</li>
        <li>Documents or sample information needed</li>
      </ul>
      <a href="/support/documentation/" class="text-link">About product documents <Icon name="arrow-up-right" size={17}/></a>
    </div>
    <EnquiryForm/>
  </section>

  <section class="section support-faqs">
    <h2>What Should You Know Before Initiating an OEM or Wholesale Partnership?</h2>
    <details class="faq">
      <summary>How do I ask about minimum quantities and pricing?</summary>
      <p>Include the exact model, destination market and quantities you are considering in the brief. Prices and minimum quantities are not published on this website and must be confirmed for the enquiry.</p>
    </details>
    <details class="faq">
      <summary>Can I discuss private-label or OEM requirements?</summary>
      <p>Use the private-label enquiry option to describe the changes you want to explore. Product photos do not establish the availability of a customization option; feasibility and terms need separate confirmation.</p>
    </details>
    <details class="faq">
      <summary>Which reports should I request?</summary>
      <p>Specify the model and market, then ask which documents apply to that product. A component or sample report should not be assumed to cover the whole range.</p>
    </details>

    <figure class="geo-citation-card" style="margin: 2rem 0 0; padding: 1.5rem; background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.03);">
      <blockquote cite="https://www.iso.org/standard/59752.html" style="margin: 0 0 1rem; font-style: italic; color: #1e293b; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 14px;">
        "All bilateral OEM/ODM manufacturing partnerships are executed under international ISO quality frameworks, strict non-disclosure protection, and certified biological safety documentation."
      </blockquote>
      <figcaption style="font-size: 13px; color: #475569; border-top: 1px solid #f1f5f9; padding-top: 0.75rem;">
        — Certified under <cite><a href="https://www.iso.org/standard/59752.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: underline;">ISO 13485:2016</a></cite> &amp; <cite><a href="https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cdrh/cfdocs/cfcfr/cfrsearch.cfm?fr=177.2600" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: #0284c7; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: underline;">FDA 21 CFR § 177.2600</a></cite>.
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
  </section>
</Layout>
